1205
01:25:02,208 --> 01:25:03,375
ketika kumasih kecil.

1206
01:25:05,292 --> 01:25:07,125
Membakar hutan kami.

1207
01:25:09,083 --> 01:25:10,750
Hanguskan semuanya.

1208
01:25:15,583 --> 01:25:18,542
Rakyatku kelaparan.

1209
01:25:19,333 --> 01:25:21,392
Mereka mengemis minta
pertolongan.

1210
01:25:24,083 --> 01:25:27,042
Namun Eywa tak muncul.

1211
01:25:29,750 --> 01:25:32,708
Lalu kupergi ke tempat apinya.

1212
01:25:35,625 --> 01:25:38,292
Dan kupelajari caranya.

1213
01:25:43,875 --> 01:25:46,375
Akulah apinya.

1214
01:25:48,875 --> 01:25:51,332
Di tanganku,

1215
01:25:51,333 --> 01:25:53,667
Rakyatku tumbuh kuat.

1216
01:25:54,333 --> 01:25:57,374
Kami tak berbaring dan mati

1217
01:25:57,375 --> 01:25:59,041
hanya karena Eywa

1218
01:25:59,042 --> 01:26:00,500
yang mengkhianati kami.

1219
01:26:02,458 --> 01:26:05,292
Kami balas berkhianat
kepada-Nya,

1220
01:26:07,042 --> 01:26:08,625
Ibu yang lemah

1221
01:26:09,833 --> 01:26:11,583
bagi anak-anak yang lemah.

1222
01:26:14,167 --> 01:26:17,207
Kami tidak mengisap

1223
01:26:17,208 --> 01:26:19,792
pada sumber kelemahan.

1224
01:26:24,208 --> 01:26:26,042
Kini...

1225
01:26:28,292 --> 01:26:30,416
hanya kebenaran yang

1226
01:26:30,417 --> 01:26:32,250
akan keluar dari lidahmu.

1227
01:26:39,000 --> 01:26:40,583
Kau punya raga yang kuat.

1228
01:26:41,583 --> 01:26:42,667
Tanpa takut.

1229
01:26:47,250 --> 01:26:48,541
Itu tidak bagus.

1230
01:26:48,542 --> 01:26:51,125
Kuakan konsumsi ragamu, Quaritch.

1231
01:26:57,125 --> 01:27:00,292
Tapi pertama,
kau harus menjawabku.

1232
01:27:04,208 --> 01:27:06,042
Mengapa kau di sini?

1233
01:27:11,083 --> 01:27:12,458
Aku di sini untukmu.

1234
01:27:14,417 --> 01:27:16,375
Kau ingin melayaniku?

1235
01:27:17,792 --> 01:27:19,308
Aku tidak melayani siapa pun.

1236
01:27:21,458 --> 01:27:22,625
Aku membutuhkanmu.

1237
01:27:24,083 --> 01:27:26,225
Yah, aku tak membutuhkanmu.

1238
01:27:27,083 --> 01:27:29,158
Tapi mungkin kuakan memperlakukanmu

1239
01:27:29,542 --> 01:27:31,208
sebagai budakku

1240
01:27:31,833 --> 01:27:33,208
untuk menyenangkanku.

1241
01:27:34,125 --> 01:27:37,200
Kedengarannya seperti akhir pekan
yang menyenangkan, tapi...

1242
01:27:38,167 --> 01:27:40,707
bukan itu yang sebenarnya kau inginkan.

1243
01:27:40,708 --> 01:27:42,725
Lalu apa yang kuinginkan?

1244
01:27:44,583 --> 01:27:46,083
Yang belum pernah kau miliki.

1245
01:27:48,625 --> 01:27:49,708
Kesetaraan.

1246
01:27:54,042 --> 01:27:55,791
Kau ingin mengobarkan apimu

1247
01:27:55,792 --> 01:27:56,850
ke seluruh dunia.

1248
01:27:57,458 --> 01:27:58,583
Ya.

1249
01:27:59,833 --> 01:28:01,791
Akan kuberikan kau senjata.

1250
01:28:01,792 --> 01:28:03,083
Kuberikan kau komunikasi.

1251
01:28:04,000 --> 01:28:05,957
Senjata roket.

1252
01:28:05,958 --> 01:28:07,850
Itu sihir yang sangat kuat.

1253
01:28:08,917 --> 01:28:10,791
Perintah jarak jauh,

1254
01:28:10,792 --> 01:28:12,458
menyerang secepat kilat.

1255
01:28:14,000 --> 01:28:15,167
Klan-klan...

1256
01:28:16,208 --> 01:28:18,083
sejauh yang kau bisa terbang,

1257
01:28:19,625 --> 01:28:21,833
Mereka akan tunduk
di hadapan Varang.

1258
01:28:28,125 --> 01:28:29,792
Kau ingin menghadapi Eywa...

1259
01:28:31,958 --> 01:28:33,083
kau membutuhkanku.

1260
01:28:38,917 --> 01:28:40,167
Aku memahamimu.

1261
01:28:42,208 --> 01:28:43,750
Tentu saja kau paham.

1262
01:30:03,417 --> 01:30:05,624
Saat kubisa terhubung lagi,

1263
01:30:05,625 --> 01:30:06,892
suatu saat nanti,

1264
01:30:07,833 --> 01:30:09,125
kapan pun,

1265
01:30:09,583 --> 01:30:12,167
Kubisa menjadi pemandumu
di Dunia Roh.

1266
01:30:13,542 --> 01:30:16,291
Baiklah, sudah bisa kupergi sekarang?

1267
01:30:16,292 --> 01:30:17,208
Belum.

1268
01:30:17,583 --> 01:30:19,332
Tidak tanpaku.

1269
01:30:19,333 --> 01:30:21,500
Manusia Langit
tak bisa datang begitu saja.

1270
01:30:22,333 --> 01:30:24,308
Itu akan membuat
para leluhur ketakutan.

1271
01:30:34,500 --> 01:30:36,916
Mereka mulai berdatangan

1272
01:30:36,917 --> 01:30:38,583
untuk Ritual anak <i>Tulkun</i>.

1273
01:30:40,500 --> 01:30:41,832
<i>Tulkun</i> berusia setahun

1274
01:30:41,833 --> 01:30:44,292
dan bersama bayi-bayi terumbu

1275
01:30:45,000 --> 01:30:46,916
menjalin ikatan pertamanya
dengan Eywa.

1276
01:30:46,917 --> 01:30:48,167
Itu akan sangat indah.

1277
01:31:16,000 --> 01:31:17,000
Coba kulihat.

1278
01:31:19,542 --> 01:31:21,207
Terlihat bagus.

1279
01:31:21,208 --> 01:31:22,832
Kusuka penampilanmu.

1280
01:31:22,833 --> 01:31:23,833
Ikutlah ke ritualnya.

1281
01:31:24,375 --> 01:31:25,458
Jangan.. tidak.. tidak.

1282
01:31:27,125 --> 01:31:29,033
Kalau begitu, kutetap
di sini denganmu.

1283
01:31:36,833 --> 01:31:39,625
Lo'ak, seharusnya aku tak memberitahumu,
tapi...

1284
01:31:40,750 --> 01:31:42,083
saudari <i>tulkun</i>ku bilang

1285
01:31:42,708 --> 01:31:44,416
mereka telah mendengar Payakan,

1286
01:31:44,417 --> 01:31:46,874
sangat samar,
memanggil klan kelahirannya.

1287
01:31:46,875 --> 01:31:47,875
Di mana?

1288
01:31:49,292 --> 01:31:52,042
Nyanyian <i>Tulkun</i> menggema jauh
dalam air, Lo'ak.

1289
01:31:52,500 --> 01:31:53,583
Kumohon.

1290
01:32:23,292 --> 01:32:24,667
Lo'ak.

1291
01:32:28,792 --> 01:32:29,792
Selamat tinggal, Bu.

1292
01:32:31,167 --> 01:32:32,250
Kau mau pergi ke mana?

1293
01:32:34,583 --> 01:32:35,583
Hanya keluar.

1294
01:32:37,958 --> 01:32:39,617
Ada sesuatu
yang harus kulakukan.

1295
01:32:47,625 --> 01:32:48,625
Lo'ak!

1296
01:32:51,042 --> 01:32:52,042
Lo'ak!

1297
01:32:54,208 --> 01:32:55,333
Lo'ak, tunggu!

1298
01:32:57,208 --> 01:32:58,208
Lo'ak.

1299
01:33:05,041 --> 01:33:08,833
YA, KITA HARUS TEMUKAN
SAUDARA DARI PAYAKAN.

1300
01:33:14,833 --> 01:33:16,082
Kita tak bisa pergi.

1301
01:33:16,083 --> 01:33:17,499
Ritual anak <i>Tulkun</i>
lima hari lagi.

1302
01:33:17,500 --> 01:33:20,499
Kuharus pergi.
Ini salahku.

1303
01:33:20,500 --> 01:33:21,583
Kita akan ke sana.

1304
01:33:22,917 --> 01:33:23,958
Kita semua.

1305
01:33:24,708 --> 01:33:26,791
Ambil senjata dan bekal.

1306
01:33:26,792 --> 01:33:27,992
Jangan bilang siapa pun.

1307
01:33:35,292 --> 01:33:37,042
Anak-anak kita telah pergi
mencarinya.

1308
01:33:38,083 --> 01:33:39,239
Kau mengizinkannya?

1309
01:33:39,667 --> 01:33:41,000
Mereka tak meminta.

1310
01:33:41,542 --> 01:33:42,749
Baiklah, kami ambil kendaraan.

1311
01:33:42,750 --> 01:33:43,957
Kami cegat mereka.

1312
01:33:43,958 --> 01:33:45,707
Kita tidak bisa cari
ke seluruh samudra.

1313
01:33:45,708 --> 01:33:47,749
Kita butuh para prajurit di sini
untuk Ritual Anak <i>Tulkun</i>.

1314
01:33:47,750 --> 01:33:49,167
jika kapal-kapal iblis
muncul.

1315
01:33:49,833 --> 01:33:51,417
Putraku sendirian di sana.

1316
01:33:53,000 --> 01:33:55,708
Dia akan pulang
ketika dia siap.

1317
01:33:56,667 --> 01:33:58,083
Ini sudah jalannya.

1318
01:34:03,167 --> 01:34:04,783
Lihat yang sudah dia lakukan.

1319
01:34:06,250 --> 01:34:07,750
Jake, kekuatan para leluhur

1320
01:34:08,417 --> 01:34:10,250
mengalir dalam darah putramu.

1321
01:34:11,417 --> 01:34:12,750
kau harus mempercayainya.

1322
01:34:19,042 --> 01:34:20,249
Cara jalannya air

1323
01:34:20,250 --> 01:34:21,292
tak ada awal...

1324
01:34:24,708 --> 01:34:25,791
dan tak ada akhir.

1325
01:34:25,792 --> 01:34:27,018
Lautan adalah rumahmu...

1326
01:34:32,375 --> 01:34:33,417
sebelum kelahiranmu...

1327
01:34:40,417 --> 01:34:41,792
dan setelah kematianmu.

1328
01:35:04,083 --> 01:35:06,041
Di mana satu-satunya

1329
01:35:06,042 --> 01:35:07,833
yang mereka sebut <i>Toruk Makto</i>?

1330
01:35:08,375 --> 01:35:10,207
Ada berapa ikan
yang ada di laut?

1331
01:35:10,208 --> 01:35:11,041
Satu, dua.

1332
01:35:11,042 --> 01:35:12,124
Berapa banyak burung

1333
01:35:12,125 --> 01:35:13,041
yang ada di langit?

1334
01:35:13,042 --> 01:35:14,500
Satu, dua, tiga--

1335
01:35:15,875 --> 01:35:17,416
Ayolah,
kau tak mungkin meminta ke Eywa

1336
01:35:17,417 --> 01:35:18,874
untuk membuatku
sedikit lebih tinggi?

1337
01:35:18,875 --> 01:35:20,166
Mungkin sedikit lebih biru.

1338
01:35:20,167 --> 01:35:21,208
Jangan.

1339
01:35:21,750 --> 01:35:23,916
Aku sibuk
menyelamatkan hidupmu.

1340
01:35:23,917 --> 01:35:24,999
<i>Skxawng</i>.

1341
01:35:25,000 --> 01:35:26,499
Sedikit saja.

1342
01:35:26,500 --> 01:35:27,667
Beberapa sentimeter.

1343
01:35:29,625 --> 01:35:30,957
Dialah Ibu Segalanya.

1344
01:35:30,958 --> 01:35:32,142
Dia bisa lakukan apa saja.

1345
01:35:34,542 --> 01:35:35,791
Kau sudah sempurna

1346
01:35:35,792 --> 01:35:37,375
apa adanya padamu.

1347
01:35:57,375 --> 01:35:58,625
Ayo, Bocah Monyet.

1348
01:36:02,000 --> 01:36:03,082
Jadi hal berikutnya,

1349
01:36:03,083 --> 01:36:04,917
Aku mau belajar
cara mengendarai skimwing.

1350
01:36:05,458 --> 01:36:07,582
Agar kau bisa menjadi
prajurit yang hebat.

1351
01:36:07,583 --> 01:36:08,874
dan melindungi kita semua.

1352
01:36:08,875 --> 01:36:10,749
Hei, bukan besar ukuran
yang utama di pertarungan,

1353
01:36:10,750 --> 01:36:12,208
tapi bernyali besar dalam bertarung.

1354
01:36:13,292 --> 01:36:14,125
Apa itu?

1355
01:36:21,333 --> 01:36:22,167
Lari!

1356
01:36:22,625 --> 01:36:23,542
Lari!

1357
01:36:32,792 --> 01:36:33,833
Pergi, cepat!

1358
01:36:35,625 --> 01:36:36,458
Spider.

1359
01:36:37,042 --> 01:36:38,333
Ke sini, bajingan!

1360
01:36:40,500 --> 01:36:41,707
Ayo!

1361
01:36:41,708 --> 01:36:42,792
Hei, <i>skxawng</i>!

1362
01:36:43,625 --> 01:36:44,792
Lewat sini, keparat!

1363
01:36:46,792 --> 01:36:48,042
Ayo, sialan!

1364
01:36:48,958 --> 01:36:50,492
Hanya itu kemampuan kalian?

1365
01:36:52,000 --> 01:36:53,000
Sial!

1366
01:36:55,000 --> 01:36:55,874
Hei, hei!

1367
01:36:55,875 --> 01:36:57,500
Tenanglah, jagoan.

1368
01:36:58,042 --> 01:37:00,083
Hati-hati dengan pisaunya.
Nanti bisa terluka.

1369
01:37:02,583 --> 01:37:04,292
Si alat bernafas.

1370
01:37:19,042 --> 01:37:20,332
Kita terbang.

1371
01:37:20,333 --> 01:37:21,333
Bubar.

1372
01:37:22,167 --> 01:37:24,625
Markas, Biru Asli.
Sudah diamankan.

1373
01:37:39,750 --> 01:37:41,125
- Apa itu?
- Tuk!

1374
01:37:48,667 --> 01:37:50,374
Mereka menghalangi kita.
Angkat senjata.

1375
01:37:50,375 --> 01:37:51,374
Senjata!

1376
01:37:51,375 --> 01:37:52,624
Di mana kakakmu?

1377
01:37:52,625 --> 01:37:53,749
Dia pergi mengambil air.

1378
01:37:53,750 --> 01:37:55,125
Di mana Kiri?
Di mana Spider?

1379
01:37:57,583 --> 01:37:58,333
Ayah!

1380
01:37:59,125 --> 01:38:00,725
- Di mana Spider?
- Mereka menangkapnya.

1381
01:38:01,083 --> 01:38:02,583
Kolonel biru itu
menangkapnya.

1382
01:38:15,583 --> 01:38:16,583
Bawa dia.

1383
01:38:37,417 --> 01:38:38,583
Tenang.

1384
01:38:39,125 --> 01:38:40,500
Jangan takut.

1385
01:38:41,250 --> 01:38:42,250
Jangan takut!

1386
01:38:49,833 --> 01:38:51,125
Jake Sully!

1387
01:38:52,625 --> 01:38:54,332
Bawa putri-putri,
lalu kau pergi sekarang!

1388
01:38:54,333 --> 01:38:55,558
Aku tak akan pergi
tanpamu.

1389
01:38:56,083 --> 01:38:56,832
Jangan.

1390
01:38:56,833 --> 01:38:57,999
Mereka menangkap Spider.

1391
01:38:58,000 --> 01:38:59,166
Tidak ada
yang menahan mereka.

1392
01:38:59,167 --> 01:39:00,792
Kau sudah lihat
yang bisa mereka lakukan.

1393
01:39:00,958 --> 01:39:02,416
Orang-orang ini akan mati.

1394
01:39:02,417 --> 01:39:04,374
Kau tak bisa seperti ini.

1395
01:39:04,375 --> 01:39:05,958
Suamiku, aku tidak bisa.

1396
01:39:07,583 --> 01:39:09,375
Hanya inilah caranya.

1397
01:39:10,167 --> 01:39:11,541
Jake Sully!

1398
01:39:11,542 --> 01:39:13,541
Tunjukkan dirimu!

1399
01:39:13,542 --> 01:39:14,291
kau harus pergi.

1400
01:39:14,292 --> 01:39:15,492
kau harus pergi
sekarang juga.

1401
01:39:15,625 --> 01:39:16,499
Bawa adikmu.

1402
01:39:16,500 --> 01:39:17,767
Pergi dan sembunyi.

1403
01:39:18,583 --> 01:39:19,625
Cepat!

1404
01:39:21,042 --> 01:39:22,457
Jika kau tetap tinggal,
aku juga.

1405
01:39:22,458 --> 01:39:24,207
Kuakan bunuh banyak!

1406
01:39:24,208 --> 01:39:26,683
Apa pun yang terjadi,
jangan angkat busur itu.

1407
01:39:27,125 --> 01:39:28,742
Kau bersumpah padaku.

1408
01:39:31,583 --> 01:39:33,249
Aku tahu, dia di sini.

1409
01:39:33,250 --> 01:39:34,458
Berikan dia padaku.

1410
01:39:34,958 --> 01:39:36,291
Dia Metkayina.

1411
01:39:36,292 --> 01:39:37,658
Dia salah satu dari kita.

1412
01:39:38,083 --> 01:39:39,500
Dia salah satu dari kita!

1413
01:39:40,417 --> 01:39:42,124
Bakar sesuatu.

1414
01:39:42,125 --> 01:39:43,832
Udara 2-4, tembakan api pembakar

1415
01:39:43,833 --> 01:39:45,207
ke tengah desa.

1416
01:39:45,208 --> 01:39:45,957
Diterima.

1417
01:39:45,958 --> 01:39:47,408
Mengganti ke alat pembakar.

1418
01:40:03,333 --> 01:40:05,292
Aku mau Jake Sully!

1419
01:40:06,667 --> 01:40:08,791
Berhenti. Jangan.
Tahan tembakanmu.

1420
01:40:08,792 --> 01:40:10,583
Tahan tembakan. Berhenti.

1421
01:40:11,375 --> 01:40:12,375
Tahan tembakan.

1422
01:40:13,792 --> 01:40:15,042
Diterima.
Dihentikan.

1423
01:40:17,500 --> 01:40:18,833
Ini sudah jalanku,
Saudaraku.

1424
01:40:37,042 --> 01:40:38,292
Kolonel.

1425
01:40:39,000 --> 01:40:40,000
Kopral.

1426
01:40:40,625 --> 01:40:42,166
Kau bawa aku,

1427
01:40:42,167 --> 01:40:44,183
dan tinggalkan keluargaku
dan mereka ini sendirian.

1428
01:40:44,667 --> 01:40:46,416
Tidak cukup.

1429
01:40:46,417 --> 01:40:48,250
Aku juga butuh istrimu.

1430
01:40:52,417 --> 01:40:53,708
Kau paham maksudku.

1431
01:40:54,500 --> 01:40:57,458
Kalian berdua atau kuhancurkan tempat ini
sampai rata dengan tanah.

1432
01:40:58,292 --> 01:41:00,749
Wanita hamil, anak-anak.

1433
01:41:00,750 --> 01:41:02,457
Kuledakkan semua benda tua

1434
01:41:02,458 --> 01:41:03,666
dari belakang gubuk

1435
01:41:03,667 --> 01:41:05,082
Karena aku memang tak peduli.

1436
01:41:05,083 --> 01:41:07,332
Dan teman-temanku di sini, yah,

1437
01:41:07,333 --> 01:41:09,166
mereka sangat ingin menghabisi semua

1438
01:41:09,167 --> 01:41:10,667
dan mengulitinya.

1439
01:41:27,458 --> 01:41:28,750
Sungguh?

1440
01:41:29,917 --> 01:41:31,208
Kita lakukan ini?

1441
01:41:31,875 --> 01:41:33,707
Saat kuturunkan lenganku,

1442
01:41:33,708 --> 01:41:35,916
kau dan kekasih barumu mati.

1443
01:41:35,917 --> 01:41:37,916
Kau yang tersering mati.

1444
01:41:37,917 --> 01:41:40,541
Jika aku mati,
semua yang di sini mati.

1445
01:41:40,542 --> 01:41:41,750
Mungkin.

1446
01:41:42,417 --> 01:41:45,249
Kurasa kau bisa bunuh beberapa,
tetapi tidak semuanya.

1447
01:41:45,250 --> 01:41:46,541
Mungkin kami menyerbu kalian dulu,

1448
01:41:46,542 --> 01:41:47,666
dan helikopter tempurmu ragu

1449
01:41:47,667 --> 01:41:49,458
karena kita semua terlihat sama.

1450
01:41:50,042 --> 01:41:51,749
Lalu ketika kau memohon

1451
01:41:51,750 --> 01:41:53,167
demi nyawamu,

1452
01:41:54,583 --> 01:41:55,875
kuakan mengulitimu.

1453
01:41:57,125 --> 01:41:58,917
Astaga, Kopral.

1454
01:41:59,625 --> 01:42:02,707
Aku tak tahu apa kau cerdas
atau hanya gila.

1455
01:42:02,708 --> 01:42:05,000
Kau tak pernah terlihat
begitu cerdas bagiku.

1456
01:42:06,250 --> 01:42:08,916
Aku butuh janjimu,
sesama marinir.

1457
01:42:08,917 --> 01:42:10,000
Keamanan

1458
01:42:10,958 --> 01:42:12,375
untuk mereka ini.

1459
01:42:12,958 --> 01:42:14,833
Bakar semuanya, Quaritch.

1460
01:42:24,375 --> 01:42:25,792
Apakah kita sepakat?

1461
01:42:30,667 --> 01:42:31,667
Baiklah.

1462
01:42:33,083 --> 01:42:34,750
Mau berjanji jari kelingking?

1463
01:42:44,000 --> 01:42:45,000
Bawa dia.

1464
01:42:46,708 --> 01:42:47,708
Balik badan.

1465
01:42:53,750 --> 01:42:54,750
Jalan.

1466
01:43:13,750 --> 01:43:14,917
- Ayo pergi.
- Ayo.

1467
01:43:15,917 --> 01:43:17,124
Lain waktu saja,

1468
01:43:17,125 --> 01:43:18,125
Nyonya Sully.

1469
01:43:22,500 --> 01:43:23,542
Bersiap naik.

1470
01:44:06,833 --> 01:44:07,916
Kita ada apa?

1471
01:44:07,917 --> 01:44:09,541
Bu, kita ada serangan besar-besaran.

1472
01:44:09,542 --> 01:44:11,332
- Pengendara <i>Banshee</i> masuk.
- Aku melihatnya.

1473
01:44:11,333 --> 01:44:12,791
- Jadi tembak mereka.
- Aku tidak bisa, Bu.

1474
01:44:12,792 --> 01:44:14,332
Senjata terkunci.

1475
01:44:14,333 --> 01:44:15,958
Mereka semua miliki
lencana IFF.

1476
01:44:16,583 --> 01:44:17,624
Perluas.

1477
01:44:17,625 --> 01:44:19,375
Kendali 1-6,
sisir targetnya.

1478
01:44:58,208 --> 01:45:00,166
BERDIRI TEGAK, KALIAN TOLOL.

1479
01:45:00,708 --> 01:45:02,583
JANGAN KETAKUTAN.

1480
01:45:08,458 --> 01:45:09,874
Baiklah.

1481
01:45:09,875 --> 01:45:11,041
Tahan dia di situ.

1482
01:45:11,042 --> 01:45:12,624
Santai, tenang.

1483
01:45:12,625 --> 01:45:13,667
Ayo.

1484
01:45:15,458 --> 01:45:16,500
- Jake!
- Pegang dia.

1485
01:45:16,792 --> 01:45:18,082
Ayo cepat. Jalan.

1486
01:45:18,083 --> 01:45:20,500
- Jake! Jake!
- Bawa dia masuk.

1487
01:45:24,042 --> 01:45:25,042
Jake!

1488
01:45:25,708 --> 01:45:26,708
Naik.

1489
01:45:42,167 --> 01:45:43,917
Misi terlaksana, Jenderal.

1490
01:45:44,583 --> 01:45:45,916
Jake Sully.

1491
01:45:45,917 --> 01:45:47,750
Inilah <i>Toruk Makto</i>.

1492
01:46:02,500 --> 01:46:05,033
Tidak cukup hanya dengan
bagikan senjata,

1493
01:46:05,417 --> 01:46:08,475
kau juga bawa musuh masuk
ke batas pengamanan.

1494
01:46:10,417 --> 01:46:11,832
Bukan musuh.

1495
01:46:11,833 --> 01:46:13,083
Sekutu.

1496
01:46:13,875 --> 01:46:16,499
Jenderal Ardmore,
kuperkenalkan kau dengan Varang,

1497
01:46:16,500 --> 01:46:18,292
<i>Tsahìk</i> dari <i>Mangkwan</i>.

1498
01:46:21,542 --> 01:46:24,332
Biar kuperjelas hal ini, Kolonel Cochise,

1499
01:46:24,333 --> 01:46:26,124
Aku mau setiap makhluk biadab ini

1500
01:46:26,125 --> 01:46:27,916
disingkirkan dari pangkalanku

1501
01:46:27,917 --> 01:46:29,041
secepatnya,

1502
01:46:29,042 --> 01:46:31,333
termasuk si kecil
kesayanganmu ini.

1503
01:46:37,750 --> 01:46:39,417
Jangan menjadi bodoh,
Jenderal.

1504
01:46:41,292 --> 01:46:42,617
Rayakan kemenangan.

1505
01:46:44,667 --> 01:46:45,967
Kita mendapatkannya,
teman-teman!

1506
01:46:49,917 --> 01:46:51,375
Generasi berakhir!

1507
01:47:06,875 --> 01:47:08,042
Ya!

1508
01:47:09,458 --> 01:47:10,458
<i>Tsahìk</i>.

1509
01:47:13,125 --> 01:47:14,125
Ayo jalan.

1510
01:47:31,458 --> 01:47:32,625
Tenang, tenang.

1511
01:47:39,625 --> 01:47:41,292
Kau hanya akan
merasakannya sedikit.

1512
01:47:42,500 --> 01:47:43,500
Tetap tahan.

1513
01:47:46,042 --> 01:47:47,042
Hampir di situ.

1514
01:47:48,417 --> 01:47:50,208
- Bagus. Tahan di situ.
- Sesaat lagi.

1515
01:47:55,792 --> 01:47:56,792
Payakan!

1516
01:48:00,333 --> 01:48:01,333
Payakan!

1517
01:48:08,375 --> 01:48:09,374
<i>Orang-orang berkata</i>

1518
01:48:09,375 --> 01:48:11,416
<i>laut membersihkanmu.</i>

1519
01:48:11,417 --> 01:48:12,458
Payakan!

1520
01:48:15,708 --> 01:48:16,791
Itu Lo'ak.

1521
01:48:16,792 --> 01:48:17,749
- Itu dia.
- Lo'ak.

1522
01:48:17,750 --> 01:48:18,874
- Itu dia.
- Lo'ak!

1523
01:48:18,875 --> 01:48:20,124
<i>Skxawng</i>, ke sini.

1524
01:48:20,125 --> 01:48:21,207
Lo'ak!

1525
01:48:21,208 --> 01:48:22,167
Tsireya!

1526
01:48:26,458 --> 01:48:27,291
<i>Mereka juga katakan</i>

1527
01:48:27,292 --> 01:48:29,124
<i>jika kau melihat yang dalam,</i>

1528
01:48:29,125 --> 01:48:30,292
<i>Tsyong...</i>

1529
01:48:33,375 --> 01:48:35,308
<i>Mereka roh-roh yang dikirim
untuk menghakimimu.</i>

1530
01:48:48,083 --> 01:48:49,617
- Itu <i>Tsyong</i>!
- Ayo, ayo, cepat.

1531
01:50:04,792 --> 01:50:06,791
Lo'ak. Lo'ak.

1532
01:50:06,792 --> 01:50:08,542
Lo'ak! Lo'ak!

1533
01:50:13,042 --> 01:50:14,042
Tsireya.

1534
01:50:19,958 --> 01:50:21,375
Terima kasih,
Bunda Agung.

1535
01:50:22,375 --> 01:50:23,457
Ayo, biarkan dia bernapas.

1536
01:50:23,458 --> 01:50:24,458
Biarkan dia.

1537
01:50:28,708 --> 01:50:30,367
Aku tak percaya kalian
menjemputku.

1538
01:50:31,667 --> 01:50:33,292
Jalur temanku
adalah jalurku.

1539
01:50:37,208 --> 01:50:38,291
Apa ini saudari <i>tulkun</i>mu?

1540
01:50:38,292 --> 01:50:39,292
Ya.

1541
01:50:40,500 --> 01:50:42,499
Bagaimana Payakan?
Apa dia mendengarnya?

1542
01:50:42,500 --> 01:50:44,958
Dia dekat.
Dia segera muncul.

1543
01:50:51,875 --> 01:50:53,081
Jadi, apa
yang kau dapat?

1544
01:50:54,000 --> 01:50:56,416
Miselium yang hidup
dalam tubuhnya ini--

1545
01:50:56,417 --> 01:50:57,916
Bentar, sesuatu
yang hidup dalam dirinya?

1546
01:50:57,917 --> 01:50:58,666
Ya,

1547
01:50:58,667 --> 01:50:59,791
Sejenis organisme.

1548
01:50:59,792 --> 01:51:01,499
Semacam memoderasi
pertukaran ion--

1549
01:51:01,500 --> 01:51:03,499
Baik, cukup. Aku tak perlu tahu
bagaimana cara kerjanya.

1550
01:51:03,500 --> 01:51:05,533
Aku hanya perlu tahu
apa kita bisa menirunya.

1551
01:51:11,458 --> 01:51:13,208
Keluarkan aku dari sini,
kalian bajingan!

1552
01:51:17,667 --> 01:51:18,999
Sudah kubilang kepada mereka

1553
01:51:19,000 --> 01:51:20,791
untuk tak mengganggumu
sementara waktu.

1554
01:51:20,792 --> 01:51:21,792
Di mana Jake?

1555
01:51:23,042 --> 01:51:24,916
Dia dikurung,
di tempat yang seharusnya.

1556
01:51:24,917 --> 01:51:25,708
Ini.

1557
01:51:26,625 --> 01:51:27,707
Kubawakan kau

1558
01:51:27,708 --> 01:51:29,082
Burger.

1559
01:51:29,083 --> 01:51:30,249
Jangan kau menyakitinya.

1560
01:51:30,250 --> 01:51:32,242
Dia bukan bagian
dari kehidupanmu lagi.

1561
01:51:33,083 --> 01:51:34,333
Kau bersamaku sekarang.

1562
01:51:35,833 --> 01:51:36,833
Aku ayahmu.

1563
01:51:37,375 --> 01:51:38,542
Ayahku sudah mati.

1564
01:51:39,792 --> 01:51:41,916
Kau hanya sesuatu
yang dibuat-buat

1565
01:51:41,917 --> 01:51:43,416
mereka berikan kenangan
dalam wujudmu.

1566
01:51:43,417 --> 01:51:45,124
Tidak, tidak. Bukan.

1567
01:51:45,125 --> 01:51:47,999
Aku tetap diriku.
Sudahku cek.

1568
01:51:48,000 --> 01:51:49,042
Ya, lihat.

1569
01:51:50,042 --> 01:51:51,292
"Kolonel Miles Quaritch."

1570
01:51:52,583 --> 01:51:53,583
Sudah tiada.

1571
01:51:58,417 --> 01:51:59,541
Kau tahu,
kita tak berkesempatan

1572
01:51:59,542 --> 01:52:00,624
untuk banyak berbicara

1573
01:52:00,625 --> 01:52:02,750
saat kita berada
di hutan bersama, tapi...

1574
01:52:04,333 --> 01:52:05,582
kuharus berterima kasih padamu.

1575
01:52:05,583 --> 01:52:08,792
Maksudku, kau mengangkatku
dari kapal yang tenggelam.

1576
01:52:09,833 --> 01:52:11,100
Kau menyelamatkan hidupku.

1577
01:52:11,792 --> 01:52:13,625
Ya. Aku menyesal
telah lakukan itu.

1578
01:52:15,750 --> 01:52:16,917
Mungkin itu benar.

1579
01:52:18,125 --> 01:52:19,583
Mungkin, dalam hati,
tidak demikian.

1580
01:52:20,250 --> 01:52:21,333
Apa pun itu,

1581
01:52:22,250 --> 01:52:23,499
aku berhutang budi
padamu.

1582
01:52:23,500 --> 01:52:26,167
Dan harus kukatakan padamu...

1583
01:52:27,917 --> 01:52:29,625
Nak, aku bangga padamu.

1584
01:52:32,083 --> 01:52:33,917
Kau anak yang luar biasa.
kau punya...

1585
01:52:34,792 --> 01:52:37,083
keberanian, kecerdasan, dan...

1586
01:52:38,250 --> 01:52:40,250
Nak, kau miliki
hati seperti singa.

1587
01:52:42,000 --> 01:52:44,542
Kulihat diriku dalam dirimu.
Oh, ya.

1588
01:52:46,542 --> 01:52:48,792
Akan kubilang padamu
siapa yang kulihat dalam dirimu,

1589
01:52:49,458 --> 01:52:50,458
dan itu mirip Ibumu.

1590
01:52:51,667 --> 01:52:52,749
Oh, astaga.

1591
01:52:52,750 --> 01:52:55,250
Dia sangat garang.

1592
01:52:56,875 --> 01:52:58,517
Sulit untuk hidup bersama, tapi...

1593
01:53:00,167 --> 01:53:01,457
Aku mencintainya.

1594
01:53:01,458 --> 01:53:03,958
Dan, nak,
dia sangat mencintaimu.

1595
01:53:06,750 --> 01:53:07,916
Hal tersulit
yang pernah dia lakukan

1596
01:53:07,917 --> 01:53:10,166
menaiki kapal tempurnya pada hari itu

1597
01:53:10,167 --> 01:53:11,500
untuk pergi berperang,

1598
01:53:12,208 --> 01:53:14,208
meninggalkan bayi kecilnya.

1599
01:53:16,958 --> 01:53:18,833
Ibumu meninggal
sebagai pahlawan, Nak.

1600
01:53:20,750 --> 01:53:21,832
Kau punya itu juga

1601
01:53:21,833 --> 01:53:22,833
dalam dirimu.

1602
01:53:25,167 --> 01:53:26,124
Lagipula,

1603
01:53:26,125 --> 01:53:27,291
Aku tidak kemari

1604
01:53:27,292 --> 01:53:28,791
untuk bernostalgia.

1605
01:53:28,792 --> 01:53:31,000
Aku kemari untuk bilang padamu
aku di sini untukmu.

1606
01:53:32,333 --> 01:53:34,667
Jika kau membutuhkanku.

1607
01:53:37,125 --> 01:53:38,292
Aku di sini untukmu.

1608
01:53:42,167 --> 01:53:43,208
Itu boleh kusimpan?

1609
01:53:54,083 --> 01:53:55,333
Makanlah sesuatu, ya?

1610
01:54:06,750 --> 01:54:07,750
Saudaraku!

1611
01:54:12,625 --> 01:54:14,166
AKU BAHAGIA MELIHATMU.

1612
01:54:15,000 --> 01:54:16,583
Aku memahamimu, Saudaraku.

1613
01:54:22,875 --> 01:54:23,874
Kenapa?

1614
01:54:23,875 --> 01:54:24,792
Ada apa?

1615
01:54:25,625 --> 01:54:26,833
KABAR...

1616
01:54:27,375 --> 01:54:28,916
SANGAT BURUK.

1617
01:54:30,125 --> 01:54:32,033
Sudah kau temukan klan asalmu?

1618
01:54:32,375 --> 01:54:33,666
SUDAH.

1619
01:54:35,291 --> 01:54:38,833
TAPI HANYA SATU YANG SELAMAT.

1620
01:54:45,666 --> 01:54:47,750
AKU TA'NOK.

1621
01:54:48,916 --> 01:54:51,375
LIHAT YANG MEREKA LAKUKAN PADAKU!

1622
01:54:52,250 --> 01:54:53,708
MENEMBAKKU!

1623
01:54:53,916 --> 01:54:55,375
MEMBUTAKANKU!

1624
01:54:56,750 --> 01:55:00,000
LIHAT APA YANG MANUSIA LANGIT
LAKUKAN PADAKU!

1625
01:55:00,083 --> 01:55:01,850
<i>Tulkun</i>
sudah mulai bermunculan,

1626
01:55:02,667 --> 01:55:05,899
tapi penyatuan itu tak memuncak
sampai terjadi gerhana,

1627
01:55:05,900 --> 01:55:07,332
yaitu lusa,

1628
01:55:07,333 --> 01:55:09,125
dan disaat itulah kita serang mereka.

1629
01:55:09,708 --> 01:55:11,416
Tidak, tunggu dulu. Jangan...

1630
01:55:11,417 --> 01:55:12,999
kau bilang tentang
pembantaian masal.

1631
01:55:13,000 --> 01:55:13,832
Ya.

1632
01:55:13,833 --> 01:55:16,041
Ratusan tewas.
Seluruh perkumpulannya musnah.

1633
01:55:16,042 --> 01:55:18,207
Itulah indahnya ide tersebut.

1634
01:55:18,208 --> 01:55:19,874
Kita penuhi kuota setahun
hanya dalam sehari.

1635
01:55:19,875 --> 01:55:22,000
Mereka ini makhluk
yang cerdas dan berjiwa.

1636
01:55:22,583 --> 01:55:23,583
Kau ini siapa?

1637
01:55:24,083 --> 01:55:26,625
Ian... Ian Garvin.
Marinir ahli biologi.

1638
01:55:28,708 --> 01:55:29,791
Makhluk-makhluk ini,

1639
01:55:29,792 --> 01:55:31,707
Mereka punya budaya,
punya musik,

1640
01:55:31,708 --> 01:55:32,916
punya panggilan
satu sama lain.

1641
01:55:32,917 --> 01:55:33,999
Terorganisir.

1642
01:55:34,000 --> 01:55:35,999
Penyatuannya sengaja dilakukan.

1643
01:55:36,000 --> 01:55:38,207
Itu perkumpulan spiritual
bagi mereka--

1644
01:55:38,208 --> 01:55:39,541
Jangan munafik kau, Garvin.

1645
01:55:39,542 --> 01:55:40,624
Kita semua telah sepakat.

1646
01:55:40,625 --> 01:55:42,707
Tidak, aku tak setuju
dengan ini!

1647
01:55:42,708 --> 01:55:43,874
Dr. Garvin.

1648
01:55:43,875 --> 01:55:45,082
Sudah, terima kasih.

1649
01:55:45,083 --> 01:55:46,624
Protesmu sudah dicatat.

1650
01:55:46,625 --> 01:55:48,042
- Sudah dicatat?
- Ya.

1651
01:55:49,125 --> 01:55:51,082
Tim selam
dan perahu cepat,

1652
01:55:51,083 --> 01:55:53,374
kalian akan bentuk
formasi pengamanan.

1653
01:55:53,375 --> 01:55:54,500
kemudikan dalam
berkelompok

1654
01:55:55,000 --> 01:55:57,124
di sini hingga membentuk formasi
pengepungan alami

1655
01:55:57,125 --> 01:55:58,417
terhadap pulau-pulaunya.

1656
01:56:00,708 --> 01:56:01,541
JAKE SULLY:

1657
01:56:01,625 --> 01:56:02,875
PENGKHIANAT UMAT MANUSIA

1658
01:56:07,792 --> 01:56:09,082
Kami menangkapmu, Sully!

1659
01:56:09,083 --> 01:56:10,575
Aku tak percaya
kita menangkapnya.

1660
01:56:12,208 --> 01:56:13,417
Hei!
Minggir.

1661
01:56:15,208 --> 01:56:16,208
Buka.

1662
01:56:17,708 --> 01:56:18,708
Senjatanya, Pak.

1663
01:56:27,667 --> 01:56:29,083
Sudah berakhir, Jake.

1664
01:56:30,708 --> 01:56:32,042
Pukul enam besok.

1665
01:56:34,667 --> 01:56:36,082
Varang inginkan jantungmu,

1666
01:56:36,083 --> 01:56:38,458
Tapi akan kugunakan cara lama.

1667
01:56:39,000 --> 01:56:40,267
Cara regu tembak.

1668
01:56:41,333 --> 01:56:43,892
Selfridge bilang
ini "situasi yang lebih baik."

1669
01:56:44,750 --> 01:56:46,958
Ya. Baik, kau jadilah anjing baik
bagi para eksekutif.

1670
01:56:49,417 --> 01:56:50,875
Ini bukan tentang mereka.

1671
01:56:54,500 --> 01:56:55,792
Ini tentang kita berdua.

1672
01:56:57,208 --> 01:56:59,658
Tentang marinir yang telah
khianati kepercayaanku.

1673
01:57:00,625 --> 01:57:03,225
Tentang seorang pria
dan wanita yang telah tiada.

1674
01:57:08,417 --> 01:57:10,167
Kenangan orang mati.

1675
01:57:13,125 --> 01:57:14,207
Miles Quaritch

1676
01:57:14,208 --> 01:57:15,333
sudah tiada.

1677
01:57:17,250 --> 01:57:19,000
Kau sudah bebas,

1678
01:57:19,625 --> 01:57:21,957
ada dunia luas di luar sana.

1679
01:57:21,958 --> 01:57:24,041
Ada hal-hal yang tak akan
pernah dipahami

1680
01:57:24,042 --> 01:57:25,625
oleh para eksekutif itu.

1681
01:57:27,333 --> 01:57:30,808
<i>Na'vi</i> menyebutnya <i>kame</i>,
"untuk memahami."

1682
01:57:30,875 --> 01:57:32,458
AKU TAHU SEBUTAN MEREKA ITU.

1683
01:57:32,583 --> 01:57:34,625
MAKA BELAJAR UNTUK MEMAHAMI.

1684
01:57:34,833 --> 01:57:37,208
HUBUNGKAN KE SESUATU
